{"text": "Night.\n\nI tell you a story tonight. It is about a robot. I know this robot very well.\n\nHe is small. He has two arms and one wheel. His eyes are little blue lights. His name is Pip.\n\nPip lives in a yellow house. He lives with a family. There is a mum and a dad. There is a girl, too. Her name is Zara. She is eight.\n\nPip can do many things. But he can't do one thing.\n\nWhat can't Pip do?\n\nEvery evening, Pip works in the house. He washes the cups. He cleans the kitchen floor. He puts the toys in the box.\n\nAt eight o'clock, Zara goes to bed. Mum reads her a story. Dad says, \"Good night, Zara.\"\n\nAt ten, Mum and Dad go to bed. Pip turns off the lights. One, two, three, four.\n\nNow the house is dark and quiet. Everyone sleeps.\n\nEveryone, but not Pip.\n\nPip stands in the kitchen. There is a big moon in the window.\n\n\"Robots don't sleep,\" says Pip. \"I know that.\"\n\nBut Pip wants to sleep. He wants to close his eyes. He wants to dream.\n\nZara dreams every night. In the morning, she tells Pip her dreams. She dreams about cats, the sea and cake.\n\n\"What is a dream like?\" asks Pip.\n\nPip has no dreams. He only has long, quiet nights.\n\nPip has a plan. Zara has a book about sleep. The book says, \"Count sheep.\"\n\nSo Pip counts sheep. One sheep, two sheep, three sheep.\n\nBut Pip is very fast. Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty! Fifty sheep in one second!\n\nPip is not tired. He is the same.\n\n\"Sheep are no good,\" says Pip.\n\nThen he tries warm milk. Dad drinks warm milk at night. Pip puts milk in a cup. But Pip can't drink. The milk goes on the floor.\n\nNow Pip cleans the floor again.\n\nThen Pip finds a blanket. It is green. It is Zara's old blanket.\n\nPip puts it on his head. It is too small. He puts it on his wheel. It is too small again.\n\nPip sits under the window. He is sad. His blue lights are sad, too.\n\n\"I can't sleep,\" says Pip.\n\nIt is two o'clock. Then a door opens. It is Zara. She has her toy bear in her arms.\n\n\"Pip,\" says Zara. \"I can't sleep.\"\n\nPip looks at her. His lights go on and off.\n\n\"Me too,\" says Pip.", "textSha256": "61a471b010bbac052475b56d7b23e171d2a299ce34e83c52d19c7d67c3e2bc34", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", " ", "t", "e", "l", "l", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "o", "r", "y", " ", "t", "o", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", " ", "r", "o", "b", "o", "t", ".", " ", "I", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "r", "o", "b", "o", "t", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "w", "e", "l", "l", ".", "\n", "\n", "H", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "a", "r", "m", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "w", "h", "e", "e", "l", ".", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "l", "u", "e", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", "s", ".", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "P", "i", "p", ".", "\n", "\n", "P", "i", "p", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "y", "e", "l", "l", "o", "w", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", ".", " ", "H", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "m", "u", "m", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "d", "a", "d", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", ".", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "Z", "a", "r", "a", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", "\n", "\n", "P", "i", "p", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "d", "o", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "t", "h